## Cấu hình AI (`crm.ai.config`)

```python
class CrmAiConfig(models.TransientModel):
    _name = 'crm.ai.config'
    
    ai_provider = fields.Selection([('anthropic', 'Claude'), ('openai', 'OpenAI'), ('local', 'Local LLM')])
    api_key = fields.Char()           # Stored in ir.config.parameter
    model_vision = fields.Char()      # claude-opus-4-8 for vision tasks
    model_text = fields.Char()        # claude-sonnet-4-6 for text tasks (faster/cheaper)
    model_stt = fields.Char()         # whisper-1 for speech-to-text
    auto_process_email = fields.Boolean()
    auto_process_attachment = fields.Boolean()
    auto_suggest_stage = fields.Boolean()
    confidence_threshold = fields.Float()  # Auto-move stage threshold
```

