## API Design (AI Service Layer)

Tạo `CrmAiService` class tách biệt (không model) để tái sử dụng:

```python
# models/crm_ai_service.py
class CrmAiService:
    def __init__(self, env):
        self.env = env
        self.config = self._load_config()
    
    def extract_card(self, image_base64) → dict
    def summarize_email(self, email_body, email_subject) → dict  
    def transcribe_audio(self, audio_bytes, mime_type) → str
    def summarize_call(self, transcript, lead_context) → dict
    def generate_reply(self, conversation_history, context) → list[str]
    def detect_intent(self, message) → dict
    def analyze_document(self, text, doc_type_hint) → dict
```

Dùng `claude-sonnet-4-6` cho text tasks (cost-efficient), `claude-opus-4-8` cho vision/complex analysis.

