## Thứ tự triển khai (Phased rollout)

**Phase 1 (2 tuần)** - Core infrastructure + Email AI:
- `crm.ai.config` model + settings UI
- `CrmAiService` với Claude API integration
- Auto email summarization + intent detection
- Daily digest cron

**Phase 2 (2 tuần)** - Voice + Card:
- Voice recorder UI + Whisper STT
- Name card scanner wizard + mobile endpoint
- Call summary model + log integration

**Phase 3 (1 tuần)** - Chat webhooks + Smart reply:
- Zalo/Telegram/WA webhook endpoints
- AI smart reply panel (OWL component)
- Stage auto-detection

**Phase 4 (1 tuần)** - Document analysis + polish:
- PDF/DOCX parser
- Fine-tune prompts với dữ liệu thực
- Performance optimization (async processing via ir.cron queue)
